        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Candy, Eugene Levy, Joe Seely, Mel Brooks, Bill Pullman, Rick Moranis, Robert Loggia, Meg Ryan, Daphne Zuniga, Dick Van Patten, Joan Rivers\n- Films: Armed and Dangerous, American Pie films, Tough Guys, Shag, Spaceballs\n- Roles: Noah Levenstein\n\nFacts:\n- Armed and Dangerous is a 1986 American action-crime comedy film starring John Candy, Eugene Levy, Robert Loggia, and Meg Ryan.\n- Spaceballs stars Mel Brooks, Bill Pullman, John Candy, and Rick Moranis, and it also features Daphne Zuniga, Dick Van Patten, and the voice of Joan Rivers.\n- Eugene Levy is the only actor to have appeared in all eight American Pie films, in the role of Noah Levenstein.\n- Joe Seely's other films include Armed and Dangerous, Tough Guys, and Shag.",
